# Every text file checks out LF, whatever core.autocrlf says. A CRLF checkout
# breaks scripted multi-line edits and mutation restores, reads codegen output
# as modified after every `npm run codegen`, and feeds the lefthook `sh`
# launchers a CR as part of each command; the Workflow tool refuses an inline
# script holding one (unprobed).
* text=auto eol=lf
